	(text "Lead A from SW_A3 passes the STK-HO/A 75 U-primary (pins 6-9 in, 10-13 out: + = SW_A -> SW_B) to stud\nL_A3; lead B on stud SW_B3. IL3 = 2.5 V + 10.667 mV/A (Vref 2.48-2.52 V), 0.5-4.5 V over +/-187.5 A;\n100R + 1 nF at the source. IL3R = the sensor's own Uref (pin 4), 100R + 1 nF: PV-CTL references its trip\nwindow to it. Primary at the switch node: functional barrier (4 kV rms, 8 kV impulse)."
